__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.agents/
*.egg-info/
internal/
# data/ is untracked (the owner backs it up daily), each project's data/<video>/AGENTS.md included; only the lane's
# rules for any video, data/AGENTS.md and its one-line CLAUDE.md, are tracked, so builders' worktrees have them (2026-10-17).
/data/*
!/data/AGENTS.md
!/data/CLAUDE.md
# Claude Code's per-user settings stay out; the project skills under
# .claude/skills/ are routing docs for this repo and ship with it.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
workflows/archive/
# Local symlinks to sister repos checked out elsewhere on the machine. They
# resolve only on the machine that made them, so they are never repo content.
coderef/
update-coderef.sh
# Model weights and tensor dumps are never repo content. This rule lives here
# rather than only in a machine-level ignore config: on 2026-08-28 the 37 MB of
# `bench/results/*.safetensors` on this box were excluded by a global rule
# only, so the repo was protected by one machine's setup and a fresh checkout
# would have committed them. (Until 2026-10-10 this said the JSON and JSONL
# beside them stay tracked; they moved to the untracked `data/results/` that
# day, see the rule at the end of this file and docs/state/decisions.md.)
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.pt
*.pth

# 2026-10-10 (owner): data lives under `data/`, never under `bench/results/`.
# A record there is its `.md`. Tools write to `data/results/`; these patterns
# keep a tool that still writes here from getting its output committed. A file
# a tracked check reads is added on purpose with `git add -f`.
bench/results/**/*.json
bench/results/**/*.jsonl
bench/results/**/*.csv
bench/results/**/*.npz

# 2026-10-10 (owner): contact sheets of input videos, made once by
# bench/contact_sheets.py, one folder a video. Pictures of the owner's clips
# are never repo content; the folder's AGENTS.md is, so that a session which
# lands there knows what it is looking at.
contact_sheets/*
!contact_sheets/AGENTS.md
# 2026-10-17: and the one-line CLAUDE.md that imports it, so Claude sessions load it too.
!contact_sheets/CLAUDE.md

# A project under docs/projects/ keeps material that should not be published
# (session scratch, data it was built from) in its own local/ folder.
docs/projects/*/local/
